<title>UK: IBCA assigns long-term AAA to DSL's 2001 bonds.</title>
<headline>IBCA assigns long-term AAA to DSL's 2001 bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Tuesday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to the DSL Finance NV 300 million mark 5.375 percent 2001 issue, guaranteed by Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
